This build context installs the Qwen3-TTS `qwen-tts` 0.1.1 Python package from PyPI
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS commit
6cafe5582caea83df269c36b1ce62d953a9cc66b) without its demo-only gradio dependency;
no upstream source is vendored. The files under pipelines/ are Vonk Forge wrappers
for the signed job contract.
